    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676d6b93c603d081eac0aaea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怀抱着对后冠路线非同寻常执念的四名赛马娘，\n齐聚特雷森学园，而且――还成了同班同学！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0e55b3b439794057cec27ef1ae328bec219d7eefd8c3c17c029e3a75e5804e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
